        <mxCell id="BhtPYsUqVhSGQNViGNbH-25" parent="BhtPYsUqVhSGQNViGNbH-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Classes never import each other and dependencies are resolved through tables by the Runner. Each function takes in a DF and returns a DF some functions can take in extra parameters but those will be outlined in the documentation.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
